7a6|n|A name given to the seed of certain leguminous herbs, chiefly of the genera Faba, Phaseolus, and Dolichos; also, to the herbs. ; The popular name of other vegetable seeds or fruits, more or less resembling true beans.	n:1781,54,3~1781,54,3	N:hlv,114,13;1je1,42,8;b90,36,4;27ab,29,3;ld4,8,5~hlv,114,13;1je1,42,8;ld4,8,5;b90,36,4;27ab,29,3
